<div id="S3.SS1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Therefore, we replace evaluations of <math id="S3.SS1.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla V_{\eta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla V_{\eta}</annotation></semantics></math> with</p>
<table id="S3.E2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{g}_{\eta}(y;G)\coloneqq\nabla V\bigl(\operatorname{prox}_{\eta V}(y)+\sqrt{\eta}\,G\bigr)\,,\qquad G\sim\mathsf{N}(0,I)\,." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>g</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>η</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≔</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>prox</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>η</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em" rspace="0.170em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mrow><mi>G</mi><mo>∼</mo><mrow><mi>𝖭</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0.170em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{g}_{\eta}(y;G)\coloneqq\nabla V\bigl(\operatorname{prox}_{\eta V}(y)+\sqrt{\eta}\,G\bigr)\,,\qquad G\sim\mathsf{N}(0,I)\,.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(3.2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS1.p3.2" class="ltx_p">The intuition is that
<math id="S3.SS1.p3.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\nabla V_{\eta}(y)=\int\nabla V\,\mathrm{d}R_{\eta,y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>η</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.111em">=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>d</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla V_{\eta}(y)=\int\nabla V\,\mathrm{d}R_{\eta,y}</annotation></semantics></math>, and
<math id="S3.SS1.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\law(\operatorname{prox}_{\eta V}(y)+\sqrt{\eta}\,G)\approx R_{\eta,y}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>Law</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>prox</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><msqrt><mi>η</mi></msqrt><mo lspace="0.170em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\law(\operatorname{prox}_{\eta V}(y)+\sqrt{\eta}\,G)\approx R_{\eta,y}</annotation></semantics></math>, so that
<math id="S3.SS1.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\widehat{g}_{\eta}(y;G)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>g</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>η</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\widehat{g}_{\eta}(y;G)</annotation></semantics></math> is almost an unbiased estimator of
<math id="S3.SS1.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla V_{\eta}(y)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>η</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla V_{\eta}(y)</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>